//! The `padding-left` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets the
//! width of the [padding
//! area](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Box_model/Introduction#padding_area)
//! to the left of an element.
//!
//! Initial: 0. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the width of the containing block.
